to inform you that you are free to use any of the multiple bathrooms available on each floor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Safety First -</h2>A safe work place is a happy work place, this is why we have placed multiple firearms on each floor of the office. Feel free to use them if you have to\u2014your coworkers can be replaced.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Performance Reviews -</h2>We will regularly evaluate your performance to help you grow to your full potential. While these evaluations are not mandatory, our company has a long and proud history of rewarding achievement.",
    "short_description": "It's the zombie apocalypse, but you can't miss a work day! Scavenge for weapons, survive... and don't forget to restock the toner cartridges over at accounting. This humorous top-down shooter has you working your way up the corporate ladder, all the way to the rescue helicopter on the rooftop.",
